meta {
  name: Preview Cart
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/cart/preview
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "items": [
      {
        "productId": "{{productId}}",
        "quantity": 1
      }
    ],
    "couponCode": "{{couponCode}}",
    "includeSuggestedCoupons": true
  }
}

docs {
  Prices client-side lines without a saved server cart. Auth is off so a guest preview works. After login, switch Auth to Bearer and set the token to {{accessToken}} for customer-specific coupons. At least one item is required, max 100. quantity must be positive. couponCode is uppercased by the API. Delete couponCode from the body to preview without a coupon. Needs x-shop-id.
}
